      yum install epel-release -y
      sh: 1: yum: not found
      make: *** [Makefile:164: build_rpm] Error 127
    
    #9050 pointed the job at signing-packages, which is debian:bookworm with
    signing tooling only, but addons/perl-client/Makefile still called yum and
    ci-build-pkg -- the last two references to gitlab-buildpkg-tools left in the
    tree. debian12 is broken the same way (no ci-build-pkg there either); it just
    gets cancelled by matrix fail-fast first. Latent since June because
    build_packages is gated on a paths filter, and #9231 was the first push since
    then to touch .github/workflows/*perl-client*.
    
