    pfbuild-debian-bookworm) and call rpmbuild/debuild directly, mirroring
    Makefile:248-278. The version suffix and result dir logic is ported from
    config.mk:88-106 into perl-client's vars.mk, so packages keep the suffix
    ci-build-pkg produced and still land in result/centos/8 and
    result/debian/bookworm where the upload step looks for them. The
    epel-release install is dropped: pfbuild-centos-8 already enables EPEL.
    
