    pfbuild images did not carry, so bake them in there too. Those images are
    built by the GitLab pipeline, so the workflow keeps a guarded install step
    that no-ops once the rebuilt images land.
    
    Verified by building both packages in the current images:
      result/centos/8/fingerbank-4.3.4-<suffix>.el8.noarch.rpm
      result/debian/bookworm/fingerbank_4.3.4+<suffix>_all.deb

