M	containers/packetfence-perl/debian12/Dockerfile_debian12
M	containers/packetfence-perl/rhel8/Dockerfile_rhel8

commit 2e8ca2f82eb2a807c2fd97878ace9bb7f115f538
Author: James Rouzier <jrouzier@inverse.ca>
Date:   Wed Aug 19 20:04:10 2026 +0000

    fix(ci): spell out no-dereference on the workspace chowns
    
    Both implementations in play already behave this way: GNU chown -R defaults to
    -P and busybox does the same, so with the 220 symlinks in this tree the link
    itself is retargeted and its target is left alone -- verified against a symlink
    pointing outside the tree, under GNU coreutils and under alpine's busybox.
    
    POSIX leaves the default unspecified between -H, -L and -P, though, so say -h
    and stop depending on the implementation. No behaviour change today.

