    feat(api): proxy non sql report requests to the perl API (#9207)
    
    * feat(api): proxy non sql report requests to the perl API
    
    The v1.1 report endpoints only support sql reports: searching a non sql
    (abstract) report returned a 400 and its options were built from sql only
    fields, so query_fields was missing and has_cursor, has_limit and
    has_date_range were always false.
    
    Rewrite POST /api/v1.1/report/:id/search and OPTIONS /api/v1.1/report/:id
    to /api/v1/dynamic_report/:id[/search] when the report is not a sql
    report, and hand the request over to the next caddy handler which reverse
    proxies /api/v1/* to the perl API.
    
    * Add back the dynamic_reports_routes

