    fix(pfconnector-remote): remove fingerbank-collector-remote on upgrade
    
    The host fingerbank-collector-remote package was previously a Depends of
    packetfence-pfconnector-remote. It now runs inside the combined container
    image, so dropping the Depends left the obsolete host package (and its
    systemd service) behind on upgrade. Add it to Conflicts/Replaces so apt
    removes it, matching the existing fingerbank-collector/freeradius-common
    handling.

