    feature/mysql-compressions (#9047)
    
    * Enable MySQL connection compression
    
    Enable compression on MySQL connections from both the Go DAL
    (via go-sql-driver/mysql v1.10.0 EnableCompression option) and
    the Perl pf::db layer (via mysql_compression DBI attribute).
    
    * Only enable compression for tcp sockets
    
    * Only enable compression for tcp sockets in Perl DB connections
    
    Mirrors the Go-side change in 722823307d so MySQL connections over a
    unix socket skip compression while TCP connections keep it.
    
