commit 39bf61bcf8ec5f874a1dc9a294c019f961c16bf7
Author: JeGoi <13801368+JeGoi@users.noreply.github.com>
Date:   Thu Jun 25 15:28:01 2026 -0400

    fix(vagrant): ship el8 boxes unregistered so RHEL repos stay reachable
    
    #9095 added build-time RHEL registration (baking a consumer cert into the
    box) and a runtime gate that skips re-registration when that cert exists.
    The baked entitlement goes stale once the build consumer is reaped, so a
    rebuilt box can no longer reach rhel-8-for-x86_64-appstream-rpms.
    
    Unregister + clean at the end of both el8 builds so the box ships clean,
    and drop the runtime gate so provisioning always registers fresh (matches
    maintenance/15.1).

