    * Add RADIUS authorize endpoint to pfconnector client API
    
    Add a REST endpoint (POST /api/v1/radius/authorize) to the pfconnector
    client API for rlm_rest to check tunnel connectivity. Returns
    control:Proxy-To-Realm as "remote" when connected or "degraded" when
    disconnected, allowing FreeRADIUS to route accordingly.
    
