commit 7d21cbcb07e95d1ca491d98ca7b934a0ed61beb6
Author: JeGoi <13801368+JeGoi@users.noreply.github.com>
Date:   Mon Jun 8 13:06:59 2026 -0400

    fix(ci): require DEPLOY_PKG=yes for feature branch deployment (#9080)
    
    Feature branches now require explicit DEPLOY_PKG=yes to deploy packages.
    This prevents concurrent feature branches from overwriting each other's
    packages in the shared debian-branches/ repository.
    
    **Why:** Multiple feature branches deploying to the same debian-branches/15.2/
    repository would overwrite each other based on CI_COMMIT_DATE and CI_PIPELINE_ID,
    with the most recent pipeline winning.
    
    **How to apply:** Feature branch developers must now set DEPLOY_PKG=yes in the
    pipeline to deploy their packages. Devel and maintenance branches are unaffected.

