    fix(aup): allow disabling AUP for sources under Authentication::Choice
    
    Authentication::Choice auto-discovers sources (SAML/OAuth/Guest) on the
    connection profile and builds the child auth modules dynamically, but it
    never passed with_aup to them, so they always used the default (AUP on)
    with no way to turn it off. This was visible with a SAML source under the
    Default admin SSO policy: the AUP landing page could not be disabled.
    
    Add a configurable with_aup toggle on Authentication::Choice (runtime,
    admin form, and Vue form) and propagate it to the dynamically-built child
    modules. Default remains 1 so existing setups are unchanged.

