    * usb-bootable-iso: Allow user to choose disk and GRUB device
    
    Previously, the preseed would automatically select the disk for partitioning
    and GRUB installation, which could cause issues:
    - GRUB might be installed to wrong device (USB instead of target disk)
    - User had no control over which disk to use for installation
    
