commit a503224b18e27651ecdfd93e0b44a2ea49b7280c
Author: Durand Fabrice <oeufdure@gmail.com>
Date:   Wed Apr 22 08:04:29 2026 -0400

    Harden role list virtualization and fetching
    
    Role map virtualization now measures rendered rows with a ResizeObserver
    and computes cumulative offsets from actual heights, so rows that grow
    when validation feedback appears no longer break spacer math. The slot
    v-for is also wrapped in a keyed element for stable DOM reuse, and
    unused composition-api imports are dropped.
    
    Roles fetched by the $_roles/all action now page via cursor until the
    server stops returning nextCursor instead of relying on a hard-coded
    limit=9999, which would truncate installations with more roles.

