commit 06d7ea5535e089787c4adbbd20c5e3960573da02
Author: James Rouzier <jrouzier@inverse.ca>
Date:   Mon Mar 30 09:57:59 2026 -0400

    fix/8951 (#8962)
    
    * Use servicesURL.HttpdPortal instead of adminLogin.SSOBaseUrl for SSO backend URL
    
    * Add X-Forwarded-For-PacketFence header to SSO portaltoken validation request
    
    The internal request from api-frontend to httpd.portal for portaltoken
    validation was being redirected to the captive portal page by the HTTP
    dispatcher. Adding the X-Forwarded-For-PacketFence header bypasses this
    redirect and allows the request to reach the PortalToken controller directly.
    
    Fixes #8951
    
