commit 9fdb9b9e413540c19a59a26859788c0f15c852b3
Author: JeGoi <13801368+JeGoi@users.noreply.github.com>
Date:   Tue Mar 3 17:00:32 2026 -0500

    fix(services): use systemctl show instead of cat in _unitFileExists()
    
    systemctl cat fails inside Docker containers (pfperl-api) even though
    other systemctl commands work via the mounted D-Bus socket. This caused
    stopService() to return early without ever stopping the service.
    
    Replace with systemctl show -p LoadState which works via D-Bus and
    correctly returns 'not-found' for non-existent units.
    
    Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>

