Date:   Tue Mar 3 17:00:27 2026 -0500

    fix(services): fix string interpolation in log messages
    
    "$self->name ..." doesn't interpolate the method call inside a
    double-quoted string. Use concatenation instead.
    
    Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>

