Author: JeGoi <13801368+JeGoi@users.noreply.github.com>
Date:   Fri Dec 12 09:36:42 2025 -0500

    fix(ci): use regex syntax for TEST_ONLY pattern matching
    
    Add forward slashes around $TEST_ONLY variable to enable regex matching
    instead of literal string comparison. Without slashes, GitLab CI was
    doing exact string matching, causing jobs like configurator_el8 to be
    skipped when TEST_ONLY=configurator because "configurator_el8" != "configurator".
    
    🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)
    
    Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

