    allow libvirt guests to reach 192.0.2.1 without nat
    
    fixes #5571
    When using "nat" mode with libvirt, if node01 try to reach captive portal from registration VLAN,
    it is redirected to 192.0.2.1. Consequently, libvirt nats IP address of node01 to reach captive portal.
