commit 380c0f20ae6ba93b49a82c36d5a833e96fb893c1
Author: Derek Wuelfrath <dwuelfrath@inverse.ca>
Date:   Tue Mar 17 14:57:32 2015 -0400

    Let's do some more schema modifications !!
    - iplog is iplog as we know it (current records)
