Author: Olivier Bilodeau <obilodeau@inverse.ca>
Date:   Thu Oct 27 19:09:09 2011 +0000

    getting rid of the violation closing code
    
    Closing violation is not the responsibility of the triggering modules.
    - violation of type other than trap are automatically closed after action is executed
    - violation of type 'trap' is meant for remediation and so violations of this type are closed by the portal itself
    
